@startuml
autonumber
hide footbox
title Put a publication from my library for sale in an auction

actor User
participant System

User -> System : I want to sell a publication of my library as an auction
activate User
activate System
System --> User : Please, select a publication from your Library: pub1, pub2, pub3...
User -> System : send selected publication: pub1
System --> User : Please, insert listingPrice, shortDescription, listingTitle, seller,\n initialDate, finalDate, initialPrice, buyOutPrice you want to this Auction
User -> System : provide data

System --> User : Your publication pub1 is now in an Auction
deactivate System
deactivate User
@enduml
